  hydro_cascade_coupling: { cell: ".", ev: "ROW ADDED 2026-09-16 (NWPP-36) WITH the field \u2014 n/a for this ISO at HEAD: no <iso>_hydro_cascade_{links,monthly}.csv artifact exists, so data/hydro.py::load_hydro_cascade returns None, pipeline/kwargs.py::resolve_hydro_cascade returns UNSET and the dispatch-kwargs key set and LP are unchanged (byte-identical, measured: this ISO's keeper cache_key unmoved base 6d1a144d -> head). Rules 25 [R-ISO-SCOPE] / 28(d): NWPP's measurement fills no other ISO's cell; an ISO with a measured hydraulic chain (a CROHMS-class hourly project feed, a dam inventory with surface areas, EIA-923 plant-months) enters as U and derives its own tau / band / eta / inflow from its own river." },
