    measured_chp_heat_rates: { cell: "R", ev: "REJECTED ON ERCOT'S BIN PATH 2026-09-25 (R-ERCOT-3, owner promoted the CHP-off run 2026-09-25-r-ercot2-chp-off, which carries measured_chp_heat_rates=false): the F1 power-only CHP rate double-charges host-steam fuel that ERCOT's curated bins already carve into a separate must-run tranche (rule 19); 2023 C3b 0.232 -> 0.137 with the flag off. ERCOT bin path only — no verdict transfers (rule 25). || R-ERCOT-2 (2026-09-25, 7 chpoff + 2 dam shard LPs at 8beff24d; PRECOMMIT-r-ercot-2-dam-backyears-chp-test-2026-09-25.md, RESULT-r-ercot-2-dam-backyears-chp-test-2026-09-25.md): ON ERCOT'S CURATED-BIN PATH THE POWER-ONLY CHP RATE DOUBLE-CHARGES HOST STEAM — the bins already carve host steam into a separate must-run tranche, so the steam-credited (eGRID) rate is the power-side marginal. Turning ONLY this flag off (run 2026-09-25-r-ercot2-chp-off) takes 2023 C3b 0.232 -> 0.137 and the train tier NOT-YET -> CALIBRATED; C3a 2023 +2.7% -> -3.7%, 2024 +3.7% -> +1.9%; CC_CHP +2.3..+4.8 TWh/yr. O = owner promotion ruling pending (rule 31); would read R (refused on ERCOT's bin path, rule 19 composition) if promoted. PRIOR: PROMOTED TO KEEPER 2026-09-25 (owner \"Yes promote\"). R-ERCOT (2026-09-24, 7 arm + 5 control shard LPs at b1f800e8; PRECOMMIT-r-ercot-2019-2025-inputs-2026-09-24.md, RESULT-r-ercot-2019-2025-inputs-2026-09-24.md): TESTED ON ERCOT AS ONE INPUT-CORRECTION ARM of the incumbent recipe (eia860 vintage + year-matched plant heat rates on the curated bins via the F1 hierarchy — LIVE on ERCOT's bin path for the first time, campd_bins.resolve_bin_heat_rates — + <5-day CAMPD coal/gas windows), multipliers unchanged. Registered 2026-09-24-r-inputs-2019-2025. Arm-minus-control P1 lw price +6.68/+2.38/+1.13/+1.22 $/MWh (2021/2023/2024/2025); control == keeper to <=$0.03. Forward span 2024-2025 CALIBRATED (holds); 2023 carve-out C3b 0.102 -> 0.232 FAIL; 2021 C3a +10.0% / C3b 0.202 FAIL; 2022 CALIBRATED; 2019/2020 NOT-YET (C3a +364%/+114%, 101/11 GWh slack, coal_PRB -12/-14 TWh). O = owner promotion ruling pending (rule 31). PRIOR: F1 (2026-09-24, zero LP): BACKCAST DEFAULT FLIPPED ON for every ISO by owner instruction (docs/handoffs/AUDIT-backcast-inputs-860-heatrate-outage-2026-09-24.md §5.1), coerced off outside mode=backcast; INERT on ERCOT's curated-bin path by construction (its gas/coal EIA-860 rows are excluded from dispatch in favour of the CAMPD bins), so ERCOT's measured posture is unchanged and is R-ERCOT's to revisit; verdict unchanged by the flip itself. The inputs it reads were re-derived the same day: vintage_<Y> EIA-860 tables now carry eGRID-<Y> heat rates (2019-2022 had none), and every measured artifact carries a pooled 2019-2025 row plus per-year rows (the solve year's own rate wins). This ISO's keeper years are re-solved on these inputs by R-ERCOT." },
